  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Fiery fel magic engulfs you and propels you forward. Until the end of your turn, your Speed increases by 30 feet, and your movement doesn’t provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p><p>Whenever you move within 5 feet of a creature, or of an object that isn’t being worn or carried, it makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d6 Fire damage on a failure or half as much damage on a success. A creature or object takes this damage only once per turn.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-u4m1rB9cdNv1DgHL\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Fel Wake</em> on each creature or object you pass, choosing the level you cast the spell at.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
